  "remarks": "TAi.093 Title: a) Maulavi  b) Mullah. Designation: a) Governor of Herat Province under the Taliban regime (1996-2001) b) Spokesperson of the Taliban regime (1996-2001) c) Governor of Kabul province under the Taliban regime (1996-2001) d) Minister of Internal Affairs under the Taliban regime (1996-2001). Passport no: Afghanistan diplomatic passport number D0009770, issued on 31 Oct. 2021, issued in Kabul, Afghanistan, expires 31 Oct. 2026. (Name in Latin script: KHIRULLAH KHAIRKHWA, name in original script: خيرالله خيرخواه).  Belongs to Popalzai tribe. Height: 176 cm; Listing: Listed on 25 January 2001 (amended on 3 Sep 2003, 21 Sep 2007 and 3 Oct. 2008, 12 Apr. 2010, 29 Nov. 2011 and 31. Dec 2013, 7 Sep. 2016, 10 Mar. 2026, 28 Apr. 2026)",
